      "notes": [
        {
          "category": "summary",
          "text": "New Red Hat build of Keycloak 26.0.17 packages are available from the Customer Portal",
          "title": "Topic"
        },
        {
          "category": "general",
          "text": "Red Hat build of Keycloak 26.0.17 is a standalone server, based on the Keycloak project, that provides authentication and standards-based single sign-on capabilities for web and mobile applications.\n\nSecurity fixes:\n* Keycloak error_description injection on error pages (CVE-2025-10044)",
