          "category": "summary",
          "text": "New Red Hat build of Keycloak 26.2.9 packages are available from the Customer Portal",
          "title": "Topic"
        },
        {
          "category": "general",
          "text": "Red Hat build of Keycloak 26.2.9 is a standalone server, based on the Keycloak project, that provides authentication and standards-based single sign-on capabilities for web and mobile applications.\nSecurity fixes: \n* Variable injection into environment variables (CVE-2025-9162)\n* Incomplete fix of CVE-2024-10492 (CVE-2025-10043)\n* Keycloak error_description injection on error pages (CVE-2025-10044)",
          "title": "Details"
        },
